{"text": "The children had crept in through a little hole in the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were sitting in the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the trees were covered with blossoms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But in the farthest corner of the garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was still winter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A little boy was standing there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he was crying bitterly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was too small. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To reach the branches of the tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giants heart melted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How selfish I have been. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now I know. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why the Spring would not come here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He went downstairs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And opened the door very softly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the children saw him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They ran away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And winter came back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only the little boy did not run. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because his eyes were full of tears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giant gently lifted him up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And put him into the tree.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "c", "r", "e", "p", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "h", "o", "l", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", " ", "w"